### REST API tests. Open this file in IntelliJ and click the green arrow next to a request.
### Login for every request: HTTP Basic (username password)

### 1. Admin: list admins (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admins
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 2. Admin: create a teacher (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Kamal",
  "lastName": "Hossain",
  "email": "kamal@uni.edu",
  "username": "kamal",
  "password": "kamal123"
}

### 3. Admin: create a student (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nusrat",
  "lastName": "Jahan",
  "email": "nusrat@uni.edu",
  "username": "nusrat",
  "password": "nusrat123"
}

### 4. Admin: list teachers (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 5. Teacher: list students (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Basic teacher1 teacher123

### 6. Student: my own record (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/me
Authorization: Basic student1 student123

### 7. Student: update my own record (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Basic student1 student123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rafi",
  "lastName": "Ahmed",
  "email": "rafi.new@uni.edu"
}

### 8. Student tries the admin list (403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admins
Authorization: Basic student1 student123

### 9. Student tries to list all students (403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Basic student1 student123

### 10. Wrong password (401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admins
Authorization: Basic admin wrongpassword

### 11. Not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 12. Invalid data (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "X",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "username": "a",
  "password": "1"
}

### 13. Username already taken (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Copy",
  "lastName": "Student",
  "username": "student1",
  "password": "student123"
}
